      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PEKING HUSTLER (6) was quickly into stride on debut to score by 4.5 lengths (23.89) at this track over 425m. Can measure up again. ASTON GIOVANNI (2) was drawn the middle last start but pinged the lids and recorded an all-the-way win (24.07) at this track in a Maiden H over 425m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. BLACK MASCARA (5) was a strong winner (24.03) from box 1 last time, scoring by 3 lengths at this track. Will need some luck early after drawing a tricky box here. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. RAKIN' IT IN (1) is a last start winner worth following up.",
